      "side": 1,
      "message": "So I managed to run soong_build with cwd \u003d\u003d \"/\" in aosp/1591313 and aosp/1592052, but I\u0027m not at all happy about that solution, either: it looks like there isn\u0027t a good way to transmit information between soong_ui and soong_build other than:\n\n1: environment variables (which then are made available to other processes in the same Ninja invocation, too)\n2: Hacking Blueprint to invoke soong_build with the correct cwd (this change)\n3: Implementing the cwd change with a proper design, which I\u0027m reluctant to do because it\u0027d probably be quite complex.\n",
      "revId": "4cb0220337bd98cd5b3cea8a8cf925e02971610e",
